====Usage notes====
* {{sense|female medical nurse}} ''Zuster'' generally is not used anymore as a job title in medical organisations, where {{m|nl|verpleegkundige}}, {{m|nl|verpleger}} or {{m|nl|verpleegster}} (the latter specifically for women) are the usual titles. It remains a common term in everyday language, however.

